   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="uva.00165.003.jpg" type="recto"/>
   <head type="main" rend="underline">Orange Buds by Mail from Florida</head>
   <p rend="bracketed">Voltaire closed a famous argument by
   <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">saying</del><add place="above" seq="2">claiming</add></subst> that a ship of war and the
   grand opera were <del rend="overstrike">the most signal</del>
   proofs <add place="below"><metamark target="#a001" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001">enough</add> of civilization's <add place="below"><metamark target="#a002" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002">and France's</add> <del rend="overstrike">height</del>
   progress his <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">day</del><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">time</add></del><add place="below" seq="4" hand="#h02"><metamark target="#a003" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" seq="4" hand="#h02">day</add></subst></p>
   <note type="authorial" hand="#h02" rend="circled" place="right">sent to H March 17</note>

   <pb xml:id="leaf001v" facs="uva.00165.004.jpg" type="verso"/>
   <note hand="#h03" place="top">Walt Whitman,
   Camden,
   New Jersey.</note>
   
   <note hand="#h04" type="archival" place="bottom">b1-7-3829a (81)</note>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf002r" facs="uva.00165.001.jpg" type="recto"/>
   <lg>
    <head type="main" rend="underline">Orange buds by mail</head>
    <l>A lesser proof than <del rend="overstrike"><add place="below">phrase of</add></del> Kan Voltaire's, yet greater</l>
    <l><del rend="overstrike">Not as the Keen Voltaire,</del></l>
    <l>A lesser proof <add place="below"><metamark target="#a004" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a004">than his</add> yet greater</l>
    <l><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">In</del><add place="above" seq="2">to</add></subst> my <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">poor</del><add place="above" seq="2">plain</add></subst> northern hut in <add place="below"><metamark target="#a005" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a005">outside</add> clouds and snow</l>
    <l>Proof of to-day <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="4"><add place="above" seq="1">the <add place="below" seq="2"><metamark target="#a006" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a006" seq="3">present</add> time</add></del></subst> and thee America</l>
    <l>Some three days since on their own<lb/> branches <gap extent="one word" reason="illegible"/> growing</l>
    <l>Now here their sweetness through my room diffuses</l>
    <l>A bunch of orange buds from Florida</l>
    <l>Brought for a thousand miles o'er land and tide</l>
   </lg>
   
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf002v" facs="uva.00165.002.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
</body>
